<v Ira Glass>I mean, I guess maybe I could. I just don't have the balls or I don't know, the ovaries, to live on a ranch or not have running water or whatever.
<v Ira Glass>我是说，我想也许我可以。我只是没有胆量或者我不知道，卵巢，去住在牧场或者没有自来水什么的。

