00:33:19.650 --> 00:33:47.410
<v Emily Bonderer Cruz>And I started to cry. That was 13 days after we moved to Juarez. That was the first and last time I cried over a dead body. But I remember that day thinking, what else am I going to see in 10 years here? [SIGH].
