<v Ira Glass>OK, so tonight-- and this is a typical Saturday night-- Gordo and his friend Milon are outside right now, listening to music and getting their drink on. I'm in here making some chicken, because I needed to make it before it went bad.
<v Ira Glass>好的，所以今晚——这是一个典型的星期六晚上——Gordo和他的朋友Milon现在在外面，听音乐和喝酒。我在这里做些鸡肉，因为我需要在它坏掉之前做。

