<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our show by our boss, Mr. Torey Malatia, who has-- this is no joke at all-- after all these years resigned from WBEZ this week. That is the truth. I will miss him very badly. Our program would not exist without him.
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ对我们节目的管理监督来自我们的老板，托里·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia）先生，他已经——这不是玩笑——在这么多年后本周辞去了WBEZ的职位。那是事实。我会非常想念他。没有他，我们的节目就不会存在。

01:04:02.820 --> 01:04:08.750
<v Ira Glass>And should we even do this? Yeah, we have to do this. We can't stop doing this. OK.
<v Ira Glass>而我们甚至应该做这个吗？是的，我们必须做这个。我们不能停止做这个。好的。

01:04:08.750 --> 01:04:12.250
<v Ira Glass>Torey, of course, is moving on to other things. Though what does he got planned for this weekend?
<v Ira Glass>托里，当然，正在转向其他事情。尽管他这周末打算做什么？

01:04:12.250 --> 01:04:16.470
<v Antwaun Wells>I'm gonna go commit a crime, make me some money, and then go get me a dope sack.
<v Antwaun Wells>我打算去犯个罪，赚点钱，然后去买袋毒品。

01:04:16.470 --> 01:04:29.480
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

